<section>
  <h3>Welcome to ACKS II version {{version}}!</h3>
  <p>
    Join us on <a href="https://discord.gg/RRsNCSUprY">Discord</a>.
    Report issues and request features on <a href="https://github.com/AutarchLLC/foundryvtt-acks-core/issues">Github</a>.
  </p>
  <h4>What's new:</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>NEW: The token HUD offers the <b>ACKS II Conditions</b> instead of Foundry's core status effects. Existing core
      statuses are converted to the matching Condition.
    </li>
    <li>NEW: A small subset of Conditions apply their <b>Condition Modifiers</b> to attack throws, damage, AC and saves
      while they are on. The rest are markers only for now.
    </li>
    <li>NEW: Weapons and armour have a <b>Quantity</b>, and encumbrance counts it. Quantities and coins are whole numbers.</li>
    <li>FIX: Characters and monsters that lost their own AC, attack throw, saves, weapon damage or languages after the
      14.1.0 update get their original values back. Values you entered since then are kept.
    </li>
    <li>FIX: Weapons with a saving throw show their <b>Save</b> button again on attack and item cards.</li>
    <li>FIX: Equipping a helmet no longer resets the armour's AC.</li>
    <li>Various other internal changes, fixes and improvements.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
